"As you walk through the surroundings, a sudden noise breaks the silence and" 
"puts you on alert. A quick instinct makes you spin around: a giant Bugio" 
"charges out of the shadows. A wild, violent primate combining immense strength" 
"with pure menace." 
"****"
"Driven by adrenaline, your legs move with desperate resolve. Fear tightens your" 
"chest and your heart races as you flee from the nightmare. But in the middle of" 
"the escape, carrying so much weight works against you: with every desperate" 
"step, your valuable gold coins slip from your pockets, left to the mercy of"
"fate."   
"****"
"Your breath labors and your muscles burn, but you manage to save your life." 
"Though it hurts to see your fortune ruined, your pockets are left completely" 
"empty. Your treasure has vanished and is now just a memory. (Gold = 0)"
""
